menuconfig BR2_PACKAGE_AXCLHOST
	bool "axclhost (Axera AXCL runtime)"
	depends on BR2_aarch64
	help
	  Axera AXCL host runtime for the M5Stack LLM-8850 / AX8850 M.2
	  accelerator card: libaxcl_rt + friends, card firmware
	  (ax650_card.pac), udev rules and axcl-smi. Sourced from the M5Stack
	  axclhost deb (3.6.5-m5stack1) — driver/firmware pairs must match the
	  card, do not mix vendor builds.

	  The runtime files must be vendored at
	  os/vendor/axclhost-root/ (an unpacked deb root tree). os/build.sh
	  seeds it from Projects/Axera-refs when present; see docs/axera.md
	  for manual placement.

	  https://github.com/woolcoxm/Axera-AX8850-GGUF-Support
